# CraveCart needs NO environment variables to run or deploy.
#
# Recipe discovery calls TheMealDB's public API from the browser.
# Favourites, collections, pantry, ratings and community submissions are
# stored in the visitor's browser (Local Storage).
#
# There is no server-side endpoint and no AI provider key: the CraveAI
# assistant and the Gemini translation endpoint were removed because no
# key was configured. Never put provider keys in VITE_* variables —
# anything prefixed with VITE_ is embedded in the public bundle.
